{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38206","headline":"御制春游长句 · 韩偓","name":"御制春游长句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天意分明道已光，春游嘉景胜仙乡。\n玉炉烟直风初静，银汉云消日正长。\n柳带似眉全展绿，杏苞如脸半开香。\n黄莺历历啼红树，紫燕关关语画梁。\n低槛晚晴笼翡翠，小池波暖浴鸳鸯。\n马嘶广陌贪新草，人醉花堤怕夕阳。\n比屋管弦呈妙曲，连营罗绮鬬时妆。\n全吴霸越千年後，独此升平显万方。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩偓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38206.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38206","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}